#N canvas 50 50 1400 1100 10;
#X text 20 5 Feral - raw \, unstable \, made to be played with breath. A capacitor-charge oscillator and a hard-synced slave whose ratio breath sweeps \, through a vactrol low-pass gate (opens fast \, closes slow). Fast breath changes (puffs) kick the sync \, crackle and snarl. Knobs: Sync \, Snarl \, Tone \, Tail;
